{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"339f21be-5c6e-49db-94fc-46e14b082176","step":{"id":"s1","script":"Absolute value tells how far a number is from zero. Start with zero on a number line.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Absolute value = distance"},{"op":"figure","id":"numberline","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-6,6],"y":[-1.5,2.5],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"axis","from":[-5.5,0],"to":[5.5,0]},{"kind":"point","id":"zero","at":[0,0],"label":"0"},{"kind":"segment","from":[-5,-0.12],"to":[-5,0.12]},{"kind":"segment","from":[5,-0.12],"to":[5,0.12]}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"339f21be-5c6e-49db-94fc-46e14b082176","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Positive four is four units to the right of zero. Its absolute value is four.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"positive","on":"numberline","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"posfour","at":[4,0],"label":"4"},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"zero"},"to":{"at":"posfour"},"label":"4 units"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"poseq","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|4|=4"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"339f21be-5c6e-49db-94fc-46e14b082176","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Negative four is four units to the left. Direction changes, but distance does not: its absolute value is also four.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"negative","on":"numberline","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"negfour","at":[-4,0],"label":"−4"},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"negfour"},"to":{"at":"zero"},"label":"4 units"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"negeq","anchor":{"el":"poseq","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|-4|=4"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"What is |−2|, and why?","expected_gist":"2, because −2 is two units from zero."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"339f21be-5c6e-49db-94fc-46e14b082176","step":{"id":"s4","script":"Zero has no distance from itself. Absolute value is always nonnegative; opposite numbers have the same absolute value.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"zeronote","on":"numberline","marks":[{"kind":"segment","from":[0,1.7],"to":{"at":"zero"},"arrow":true},{"kind":"text","at":[0,2.1],"text":"distance 0"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"zeroeq","anchor":{"el":"negeq","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|0|=0\\qquad |x|\\geq 0"}],"checkpoint":null}}
